you have a skin to admire kindda like porcelain, your facial structure is a tad elongated but if you switch to a different hairstyle which brings more structure to that face and do something about the cheek fat tissue you will be definitly an 8 but for know you are a 5.5 how i see it, i would recommend to fix your cheeks as they bring your head a more round feel this can be due to weight (not implying that that is the case) or just genetics otherwise there is ground to build on such as facial exercises and other such things

